  "Tabulator assets missing. Please install tabulator.min.js and tabulator.min.css in ++resource++zopyx.surveyjs/vendor/.": "\u0623\u0635\u0648\u0644 Tabulator \u0645\u0641\u0642\u0648\u062f\u0629. \u064a\u0631\u062c\u0649 \u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a tabulator.min.js \u0648 tabulator.min.css \u0641\u064a ++ resource ++ zopyx.surveyjs / vendor /.",
